PROSE SUMMARY (context, not a substitute for the structured log above)
---------------------------------------------------------------------
Long grindy 35-turn game. Key events: xNIGHTn's Relaxaurus/Chillet attacks repeatedly interrupted by Zutilt10's Cryolinx/Reindrix. xNIGHTn's Elphidran traded with Zutilt10's Lamball (turn 12), then Elphidran/Kitsun mutually destroyed each other (turn 15). xNIGHTn built up Astegon (multiple copies over the game via Pump-Action Shotgun self-damage resets), Lyleen Noct, Suzaku, and Univolt-hate (power -1000 debuffs on Zutilt10's Univolt). Zutilt10's Univolt hit xNIGHTn for 2 (turn 19, 8 to 6). xNIGHTn ground down Zutilt10 via Astegon direct attacks (turns 18/27/31/35: 3 dmg each) and Lyleen Noct/Chillet, destroying Zutilt10's Primitive Furnace x2, Mounted Machine Gun, and own Suzaku got destroyed by Strike from the Darkness setup. Finished with Astegon hit for 3 (5 to 2) then Chillet hit for 2 (2 to 0).


